{#- The tests developed so far (content file 5.1 and 5.3, "as on the home page"): seven rows, the last
    the open place. Shared by the home page and Solutions. A page may set, before the include,
    testRows = { heading: "h3" }: the rows' heading level, one under the heading that introduces
    them (the home page's rows sit under an h3 and are h4s, the default). Until the DMD and LGMD
    pages open, their rows ask about the tests on Develop a test (content 3.1). -#}
{%- set hx = (testRows and testRows.heading) or "h4" %}
{%- set arrow = '<svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="12" viewBox="0 0 18 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M1 6h15M11 1l5 5-5 5"/></svg>' %}
      <ul class="tests mt-8">
        <li class="test test-row">
          <div>
            <{{ hx }} class="h3">Sickle cell anaemia</{{ hx }}>
            <p class="label mt-2">Haemoglobinopathy</p>
          </div>
          <div class="test-what">
            <p><span class="whitespace-nowrap">LitLife™-SCA</span> screens for and confirms sickle cell anaemia in one test. Developed with CSIR-CCMB know-how for the National Sickle Cell Anaemia Elimination Mission.</p>
            <ul class="tags">
              <li class="tag tag-proof">Approved by ICMR</li>
              <li class="tag tag-proof">Patented in India and Japan</li>
              <li class="tag">Dried blood spot</li>
            </ul>
            <a class="link mt-2" href="/solutions/sickle-cell-anaemia/">About this test
              {{ arrow | safe }}
            </a>
          </div>
        </li>

        <li class="test test-row">
          <div>
            <{{ hx }} class="h3">Thalassaemia and other haemoglobinopathies</{{ hx }}>
            <p class="label mt-2">Haemoglobinopathy</p>
          </div>
          <div class="test-what">
            <p><span class="whitespace-nowrap">LitLife™-BThal</span> and <span class="whitespace-nowrap">LitLife™-AlphaThal</span> for beta and alpha thalassaemia, <span class="whitespace-nowrap">LitLife™-SiBThal217</span> for sickle cell anaemia and beta thalassaemia together, and testing for HbD and HbE.</p>
            <ul class="tags">
              <li class="tag">Dried blood spot</li>
            </ul>
            <a class="link mt-2" href="/solutions/thalassaemia/">About these tests
              {{ arrow | safe }}
            </a>
          </div>
        </li>

        <li class="test test-row">
          <div>
            <{{ hx }} class="h3">Spinal muscular atrophy</{{ hx }}>
            <p class="label mt-2">Musculopathy</p>
          </div>
          <div class="test-what">
            <p><span class="whitespace-nowrap">LitLife™-SMA</span> screens for and confirms SMA from a dried blood spot. Designed for newborn screening, where finding SMA before symptoms changes what treatment can do.</p>
            <ul class="tags">
              <li class="tag">Dried blood spot</li>
              <li class="tag">No DNA extraction</li>
            </ul>
            <a class="link mt-2" href="/solutions/spinal-muscular-atrophy/">About this test
              {{ arrow | safe }}
            </a>
          </div>
        </li>

        <li class="test test-row">
          <div>
            <{{ hx }} class="h3">Duchenne muscular dystrophy</{{ hx }}>
            <p class="label mt-2">Musculopathy</p>
          </div>
          <div class="test-what">
            <p>A genetic test for DMD: an earlier diagnosis for a boy losing strength, and carrier testing for his mother and sisters.</p>
            <a class="link mt-1" href="/solutions/develop-a-test/#musculopathies">Ask about this test
              {{ arrow | safe }}
            </a>
          </div>
        </li>

        <li class="test test-row">
          <div>
            <{{ hx }} class="h3">Limb-girdle muscular dystrophy</{{ hx }}>
            <p class="label mt-2">Musculopathy</p>
          </div>
          <div class="test-what">
            <p>A genetic test for LGMD, where the first symptom and a diagnosis are often years apart, and the subtype decides the care.</p>
            <a class="link mt-1" href="/solutions/develop-a-test/#musculopathies">Ask about this test
              {{ arrow | safe }}
            </a>
          </div>
        </li>

        <li class="test test-row">
          <div>
            <{{ hx }} class="h3">In development</{{ hx }}>
            <p class="label mt-2">Coming soon</p>
          </div>
          <div class="test-what">
            <p>A blood coagulation panel for inherited bleeding disorders, and pharmacogenomics testing.</p>
            <a class="link mt-1" href="/solutions/develop-a-test/#in-development">What we are developing
              {{ arrow | safe }}
            </a>
          </div>
        </li>

        <li class="test test-row">
          <div>
            <{{ hx }} class="h3">The condition you need next</{{ hx }}>
          </div>
          <div class="test-what">
            <p>Tell us what your programme or laboratory needs to detect. We develop the test to the same REASSURED standard.</p>
            <a class="link mt-1" href="/solutions/develop-a-test/">Talk to us about a new test
              {{ arrow | safe }}
            </a>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ul>
